SIC bundles or derives from the following third-party projects. We gratefully
acknowledge their authors.

================================================================================
1. TabICL (Soda team @ Inria) - BSD 3-Clause
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The transformer backbone in `src/sic/model/` (column embedding, row interaction,
and the in-context learning transformer) is adapted from TabICL
(https://github.com/soda-inria/tabicl). SIC also uses the released TabICL
classifier checkpoint as the initialization for survival pre-training. Full
BSD 3-Clause text below.

================================================================================
2. TorchSurv (Novartis) - MIT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A lightly modified copy of TorchSurv (https://github.com/Novartis/torchsurv) is
vendored under `src/sic/_vendor/torchsurv/` because the released PyPI version
lacked helpers SIC relies on (CoxPH baseline / survival-function utilities). Its
MIT license is kept alongside the code at `src/sic/_vendor/torchsurv/LICENSE`.

================================================================================
4. CiPOT / CSD (Shi-ang Qi et al.) - reference implementations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The post-training conformal calibration in `src/sic/calibration.py` follows the
CiPOT (NeurIPS 2024) and CSD (ICML 2024) reference implementations.

================================================================================
5. SurvivalEVAL (Shi-ang Qi et al.)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Evaluation metrics and calibration utilities use SurvivalEVAL
(https://github.com/shi-ang/SurvivalEVAL).

